      "structure_description": "A trinuclear [L²₃Gd₃Cl₅]⁺ cation paired with tetrakis(pentafluorophenyl)borate. The X-ray structure is described as having a cationic part similar to that of 9a; the supplied crystallographic formula additionally contains one toluene molecule.",
