        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "ph": null,
        "procedure": "Complex 2 in toluene was treated slowly with triisobutylaluminum at room temperature and stirred for 0.5 h. A chlorobenzene solution of trityl tetrakis(pentafluorophenyl)borate was added, followed by another 0.5 h reaction.",
